==Scots==

===Noun===
{{sco-noun}}

# {{context|vulgar|slang|pejorative|lang=sco}} [[scrotum]].

====Usage notes====
Often used pejoratively, in the same way that [[scrotum]] can be used pejoratively.

Specifically applied pejoratively to one who is foolish, annoying or in other respects a bit [[glaikit]].

Conversely may also be used a term of endearment. E.g, "Oii Chris Lyons yer a bawbag"

